/**
 * @mainpage Game_EX C++ API
 *
 * Game_EX is a modular C++20 engine, offline world compiler/runtime format, and
 * transport/city/land-use game foundation.
 *
 * The current API consists of:
 *
 * - @ref jobs for bounded synchronous worker batches;
 * - @ref startup for deterministic subsystem lifecycle orchestration;
 * - @ref core for the minimal application lifetime;
 * - @ref platform for platform-neutral boot capabilities;
 * - @ref platform_sdl for the SDL3 backend factory;
 * - @ref render for the backend-neutral presentation contract;
 * - @ref render_opengl for the OpenGL 4.6 Core backend;
 * - @ref render_vulkan for the Vulkan 1.3 backend;
 * - @ref world_format for the runtime world model and verified package reader;
 * - @ref world_compiler for strict offline staging validation and compilation;
 * - @ref game_app for the game and world-editor composition helper.
 *
 * Human-authored vision, scope, architecture, section, development, and decision
 * records live in the repository's `docs/` directory. Start with `docs/index.md`.
 */
